   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Studio contrast: crushed blacks (~2), bright clean whites (~251), median ~94, low saturation (0.22), cool-pink clean skin (177,135,115 / hue 19), faint magenta in the mids. Best for: Studio-style cover portraits against plain backdrops, black-tie and monochrome outfits, dramatic flash-lit couple portraits, editorial close-ups. Strong look - best on simple backgrounds.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
